{"id":"1db4aed433cac1d9","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-smooth-structure.md","title":"Smooth Structure","display":"df-smooth-structure — Smooth Structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-smooth-structure","aliases":["58-df-smooth-structure"],"display":"df-smooth-structure — Smooth Structure","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-atlas.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-chart.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-smooth-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-smooth-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smooth-structure — Smooth Structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d530952583f9f96d\" href=\"?note=d530952583f9f96d\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-atlas.md\">../batch05/58-df-atlas.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f9e7fe466acfa12\" href=\"?note=3f9e7fe466acfa12\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-chart.md\">../batch01/58-df-chart.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathcal A,c,d\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathcal A,c,d\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Atlas}_S\\subseteq V^4\\cup V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Atlas}_S\\subseteq V^4\\cup V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d530952583f9f96d\" href=\"?note=d530952583f9f96d\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-atlas.md\">../batch05/58-df-atlas.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chart}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{Chart}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3f9e7fe466acfa12\" href=\"?note=3f9e7fe466acfa12\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-chart.md\">../batch01/58-df-chart.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothCompatible}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothCompatible}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothStructure}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothStructure}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}structure\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SmoothCompatible}_S(c,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U,V,W,Z,\\phi,\\psi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(c=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\land d=\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\land\n(U\\cap V=\\emptyset\\lor(\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap V]\\in C^\\infty)\\land\n(U\\cap V=\\emptyset\\lor(\\phi\\circ\\psi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\psi[U\\cap V]\\in C^\\infty)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}structure\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SmoothCompatible}_S(c,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U,V,W,Z,\\phi,\\psi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(c=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\land d=\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\land\n(U\\cap V=\\emptyset\\lor(\\psi\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap V]\\in C^\\infty)\\land\n(U\\cap V=\\emptyset\\lor(\\phi\\circ\\psi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\psi[U\\cap V]\\in C^\\infty)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}structure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SmoothStructure}_S(\\mathcal{A},M) \\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal T,n\\in V\\;\\Bigl(n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,n)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall c,d\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{SmoothCompatible}_S(c,d)\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall e\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\exists U\\in\\mathcal T\\;\\exists W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\;\\exists\\phi\\in V\\;\n(e=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Chart}_S(U,W,\\phi,M,\\mathcal T,n)))\\land\n\\forall c\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{SmoothCompatible}_S(e,c)\\to e\\in\\mathcal A\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}structure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SmoothStructure}_S(\\mathcal{A},M) \\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal T,n\\in V\\;\\Bigl(n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,n)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall c,d\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{SmoothCompatible}_S(c,d)\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall e\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\exists U\\in\\mathcal T\\;\\exists W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\;\\exists\\phi\\in V\\;\n(e=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Chart}_S(U,W,\\phi,M,\\mathcal T,n)))\\land\n\\forall c\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{SmoothCompatible}_S(e,c)\\to e\\in\\mathcal A\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Smooth structures are maximal smooth atlases up to compatibility.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-atlas.md","status":"resolved","id":"d530952583f9f96d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-atlas.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-chart.md","status":"resolved","id":"3f9e7fe466acfa12","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-chart.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-atlas.md","status":"resolved","id":"d530952583f9f96d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Atlas}_S\\subseteq V^4\\cup V^2$ (see [[../batch05/58-df-atlas.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-chart.md","status":"resolved","id"